---
interface Props {
  site?: string;
}
const { site = '' } = Astro.props;
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-24 border-t border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50">
  <div class="container-page grid gap-10 py-12 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
    <div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <img src="/icon.png" alt="" class="h-7 w-7 rounded-lg" width="28" height="28" />
        <span class="font-semibold tracking-tight">GeoViewer</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-neutral-600">
        macOS 原生的照片位置查看与编辑工具。所有处理都在本机完成。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold">产品</h3>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-neutral-600">
        <li><a class="hover:text-neutral-900" href="/features">功能</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-neutral-900" href="/download">下载</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-neutral-900" href="/changelog">更新日志</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold">资源</h3>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-neutral-600">
        <li><a class="hover:text-neutral-900" href="/docs">使用文档</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-neutral-900" href="/privacy">隐私说明</a></li>
        <li>
          <a class="hover:text-neutral-900" href="https://github.com/graylogo/GeoViewer" rel="noopener" target="_blank">
            GitHub 源码
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold">说明</h3>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-neutral-600">
        本站为静态页面，由 Netlify 托管{site ? `（${site.replace(/^https?:\/\//, '')}）` : ''}。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="border-t border-neutral-200">
    <div class="container-page flex flex-col gap-2 py-6 text-sm text-neutral-500 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
      <p>© {year} GeoViewer</p>
      <p>用 Swift 与 SwiftUI 构建 · 无第三方依赖</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
